{"id":"n64498-7-5","stage":5,"title":"꺾이다 · 弯","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64498-7-5-1","ko":"이 근처에 가까운 은행이 어디에 있나요?","zh":"这附近最近的银行在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"근처에","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62061","senseId":"1","lemma":"근처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근처에","audio":"/audio/fd4c3e06470f8b90c75b.mp3"}},{"text":"가까운","meaning":"近","explanation":"가깝다：近；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가깝다","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65200","senseId":"1","lemma":"가깝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가까운","audio":"/audio/ae733feeb8d75aeaad68.mp3"}},{"text":"은행이","meaning":"银行","explanation":"은행：银行；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"은행","audio":"/audio/9630c6227715da131d3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71109","senseId":"1","lemma":"은행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"은행이","audio":"/audio/e5bb0ef1399708a6b448.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","le